"h": "7. Failure, Replay & Idempotency",
"md": "Stateless data plane → pod loss is invisible under HPA/PDB. Idempotency is inherited: GETs trivially; the callback handler (#10 acks) applies submission-keyed upserts. Quota state loss (Redis flush) fails conservative. Config rollback = registry row versioning + xDS re-push; every config change is auditable (#31).",
