"h": "5. Data Quality, Reconciliation & Lineage",
"md": "G3 rules live *in* the models (tests + constraint-shaped logic per #25's split); G4 reconciles envelope aggregates (counts, Σqty, Σmkt_val) Pre-Gold vs Stage 2 per domain per date; the CLOB is excluded from tie-out (fidelity, not math). load_id on every row joins RAW→Stage 2→Pre-Gold→publish in one lineage query (#31). Facade regression: a golden-query suite asserts legacy shapes byte-stable across canonical changes.",
