"h": "7. Failure, Replay & Idempotency",
"md": "Policy engine failure → publish blocks (fail-closed: no decision, no movement). Ledger and decisions are idempotent upserts keyed on date×domain. Replays (#21) re-evaluate the policy for their scope — a catch-up is just a replay with an automatic reason.",
