"h": "7. Failure, Replay & Idempotency",
"md": "Test infrastructure failure (not rule failure) fails the build fail-closed. Replays (#21) re-run G3 identically; results version by run with replay_id, so gate history distinguishes original vs replay verdicts. Rejects models rebuild deterministically from inputs (they are models — idempotent by dbt semantics).",
