"h": "7. Failure, Replay & Idempotency",
"md": "Either sink down → spool + drain (ordered), parity alarm; both down → pipeline continues (observability never blocks data — same principle as #31). Events idempotent on producer natural keys where re-emission possible. SLO evaluator re-runs are upserts; replays (#21) emit under replay_id so boards distinguish original vs replay operational history.",
